---
globs: data/**, src/simulate.py, scripts/simulate_network.py, src/schema.py
alwaysApply: false
---

When you work with data:

- Never edit `data/simulated/*.csv` by hand. Regenerate it with `scripts/simulate_network.py` (seeded, so it can be reproduced) and update `DATASHEET.md`.
- Never add real customer or personal data, or any data whose licence is unclear.
- Large external datasets go in `data/external/`, which is gitignored and never committed. Ask the person before downloading anything.
- Every CSV the pipeline reads must pass `src/schema.py::validate_sensor_frame`.
